          "id": "changed-constraint-answers-r1",
          "question": "Rebuilds are free and instant. What happens to the index-vs-brute-force choice and the cascade?",
          "answer": "Indexes always win on latency. Choice becomes recall-vs-latency. Widen funnels freely.",
          "anchor": "changed-constraint-answers-p01"
        },
        {
          "id": "changed-constraint-answers-r2",
          "question": "The quality metric is perfectly gameable and everyone knows it. Redesign the gate and the defense.",
          "answer": "Gate on a held-out human eval or metric family. Defense leads with the gaming analysis.",
